NatureGap is released under two licences.

Software — the Next.js/TypeScript application, the R pipeline, and the SQL
migrations and Edge Functions — is licensed under the MIT Licence below.

Documentation and data — everything under docs/, the methodology, and the
pipeline's exported data products (PMTiles, GeoJSON, JSON statistics) — is
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0). The full text is in LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Third-party input data keeps its own licence. iNaturalist and GBIF
research-grade observations are CC-BY, OpenStreetMap is ODbL, and the satellite
and orthophoto products carry the terms of their providers (Copernicus,
USGS/NASA, Portugal DGT, Netherlands PDOK).

